{"metas":[{"id":"tt33055254","type":"series","name":"Every Year After","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//nZGf0jnSJNXLf8o7iSzzX8qxHX9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/to5eI3AWbT4spz1K58mIK5HQRbD.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGAYIk2korXRooUzha3oKN1jMJ.png","description":"Six summers to fall in love. One moment to fall apart. A week to get it right. A fun, sweeping, romantic story that asks the question, what if your first love actually was your soulmate?","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt3722230","type":"series","name":"The Ultimate Rider","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tG8QDzwOwnxlHHrpZrjoqzswoVd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tG8QDzwOwnxlHHrpZrjoqzswoVd.jpg","description":"The Ultimate Rider is a high-performance reality series built to find the next professional motocross athlete. Sixteen riders. Two weeks. No outside contact. No second chances. Through relentless training, competition, and pressure, riders are pushed to their limits—physically, mentally, and emotionally. There are no eliminations. Only performance. Only progression. At the end, one rider earns a contract—and a future in professional motocross.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt42761339","type":"series","name":"Ticket to the Tribes","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//bnyAgpU8pMEZGdgjl3x9it1C0KS.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/OVKZ4qybNytbwZVO6SGOYccqKn.jpg","description":"In the new reality show, 12 Dutch and Flemish celebrities live together with the Himba community in Namibia. This means that the participants must live without modern amenities and adapt to the tribe's way of life. The participants are judged on their commitment and respect for the culture. The celebrities who adapt the least are eliminated. Ultimately, one participant remains. This person is appointed an honorary member by the community.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt38589437","type":"series","name":"The Pyramid Scheme","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//34sjPzz8xZCORirlywAJp1gUUyJ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4u16OqaVfs6qQ0DDUEK3Uo59wYK.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqLPx8SNTtwzwDZnjecNCamdWBY.png","description":"Follows the story of Goldy, an ambitious but impatient young man, whose quest to get rich through a pyramid marketing business spirals into a rollercoaster of chaos - risking not just his future, but also the love and trust of his close-knit joint family.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tmdb:324707","type":"series","name":"Patrocínio","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//r1DZd5rka497nbkN0kVJlVu2bdE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/hiRvZNcIsaKW95BWJ3kzX8LXmrM.jpg","description":"In a world dominated by filters and controlled narratives, \"Patrocinio\" breaks with the formality of one of Portugal's most influential families to offer an intimate and unprecedented access to the sisters' world. The camera ceases to be a guest at gala events and instead portrays the emotional, professional, and familial structure that sustains an empire of influence, work, and sisterhood.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt44871098","type":"series","name":"7 vs. Wild: Wildcard Competition","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//fEUPkDKEAPMXUv9MmaFG7rcj3BW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ljPwmcohnPhn0VOEeI41J4jrw2b.jpg","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt44871098/img","description":"","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt42207572","type":"series","name":"L'Affaire Céline Giboire - une contre-enquête de McSkyz","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ibvf49RExx4dC6HdZmX8554ObIw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4fbAiQcmzqGpqXaOMVgmFPt20hf.jpg","description":"On February 28, 2012, the body of 16-year-old Céline Giboire was found at the foot of a cliff in the Corbières park in Saint-Malo. Since then, her family has rejected the suicide theory put forward by the authorities and has fought to uncover the truth about the circumstances of her death. McSkyz revisits the case in an attempt to understand what happened to Céline.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt39221314","type":"series","name":"The 50","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tqmEZksj5AMYphDzr0WDCF7Z7I3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/54W3B9UEn68Oc9cnTsEw3fyyCkD.jpg","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt39221314/img","description":"Tension and strategy, clashes and provocations, but also fun, relationships and friendships, are the ingredients of The 50, the new reality game in which 50 of the most popular Italian celebrities and influencers will compete in a series of tests.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt50760081","type":"series","name":"Beating the Odds","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//9jodzeEKpKeh8UvINi6INmcgfAu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/2KKbAtzJBR23rn8bcEiZ4NIIr9f.jpg","description":"BEATing The Odds: BEAT is charting a new course. After a winless streak, the team has decided to make a change. With a new structure and renewed ambition, the quest for improvement begins. But in a sport where every detail matters, the question is: is this enough to truly break through?","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt7631058","type":"series","name":"The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/Njc1wi8WgXh2uhJ6nx-6XPBgo_Q=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvdHZzZXJpZXMvM2M3YzNlMDItYmQ1Yy00NGIzLWEwYzctZDc3MDlmMWZmZDhhLmpwZw==","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/uVOcz7JBOuZxsx9IYpx6Ah174LX.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fA1eS6rfYjS9W8AZbBVG0fpxXn1.png","description":"Tomatometer 85%"},{"id":"tt11363282","type":"series","name":"The Real Housewives of Salt Lake City","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8